<view class="page"><view class="tabs"><view wx:for="{{tabs}}" wx:key="*this" class="tab {{tab === index ? 'active' : ''}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="chooseTab">{{item}}<text wx:if="{{index === 0 && couponCount}}">（{{couponCount}}）</text></view></view><view wx:for="{{visible}}" wx:key="id" class="coupon"><view class="face"><image wx:if="{{item.image}}" src="{{item.image}}" mode="aspectFill"/><text wx:else>券</text></view><view class="details"><text class="name">{{item.name}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.isProductVoucher}}" class="gift-name">赠送：{{item.giftProductName || '指定商品'}} 1 件</text><text wx:if="{{item.isProductVoucher && item.giftPriceText}}" class="gift-price">{{item.giftPriceText}}</text><text wx:if="{{!item.isProductVoucher}}">{{item.minimumText}} · {{item.description || '到店点单可用'}}</text><text>有效期至 {{item.expiryText}}</text></view><view class="coupon-action"><text class="amount">{{item.amountText}}</text><button wx:if="{{item.status === 'available'}}" class="use-button {{item.usable === false ? 'disabled-button' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="useCoupon" loading="{{usingId == item.id}}" disabled="{{usingId || item.usable === false}}">{{item.actionText}}</button></view></view><view wx:if="{{!visible.length}}" class="empty">暂无相关优惠券</view><view class="hint">商品兑换券点击“去使用”后会将赠送商品加入当前桌台购物车；优惠券可叠加会员价，但不能使用赠金。</view></view>
